SUM((PFDATAID( [Dim KPI List (20194)].[KPI code (20201)] ) <> 2)) AS [$Measure0], MIN([MinMaxColumnPositionCallback](PFDATAID( [Dim KPI List (20194)].[KPI code (20201)] ))) AS [$Measure1], MAX([MinMaxColumnPositionCallback](PFDATAID( [Dim KPI List (20194)].[KPI code (20201)] ))) AS [$Measure2], COUNT() AS [$Measure3]
